# Application code

- Strict TypeScript. Validate untrusted input at every boundary against `schemas/`.
- Arabic UI uses logical CSS properties. Set `dir` from the locale. Bidi-isolate URLs, code and numbers inside Arabic text.
- Arabic copy needs native review before it ships.
